{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryItems\">Inventory Items</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Custom Customer Is On Pending Qty QtyToDeliver To ToDate\">The <strong>Qty to Deliver</strong> screen displays pending delivery commitments organized by customer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Customers Delivered InventoryItem InventoryItems Is Item To ToDate\">This screen tracks inventory items that have been sold to customers but not yet delivered.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Customers On Sent To ToDate\">The quantities shown represent outstanding obligations to deliver physical goods to customers.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Name Pending To ToDate\">Shows the customer name for each pending delivery commitment.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"QtyToDeliver\">Qty to deliver</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Item To ToDate\">Shows the quantity of items awaiting delivery to each customer.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Amount Is On Pending To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">Click the <strong>quantity</strong> to view the detailed transactions that make up this pending amount.</p></div></details>",
